From: GreenAutarky OS <noreply@greenautarky.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] hassio: map armv7 to OCI arm/v7 for skopeo

fetch-container-image.sh maps only aarch64 to its OCI name (arm64) and
passes every other HAOS arch through. "armv7" is not an OCI architecture:
for a multi-arch index skopeo finds no matching manifest. Map it to
arch "arm" + variant "v7".

Measured 2026-10-07: the GA armv7 images are single-arch docker v2
manifests, which skopeo resolves regardless of --override-arch, so the
unpatched script happens to work for them today. The patch makes the
result not depend on how the registry happens to publish the image.
---
diff --git a/buildroot-external/package/hassio/fetch-container-image.sh b/buildroot-external/package/hassio/fetch-container-image.sh
index 1a73a08f1..950e08b79 100755
--- a/buildroot-external/package/hassio/fetch-container-image.sh
+++ b/buildroot-external/package/hassio/fetch-container-image.sh
@@ -42,13 +42,16 @@ image_tag=$(jq -e -r --arg image_json_name "${image_json_name}" \
 	'.[$image_json_name]' < "${version_json}")
 full_image_name="${image_name}:${image_tag}"
 
-# Map HAOS arch to OCI platform arch for skopeo
+# Map HAOS arch to OCI platform arch (+ variant) for skopeo
+oci_variant=""
 case "${arch}" in
 	aarch64) oci_arch="arm64" ;;
+	armv7) oci_arch="arm"; oci_variant="v7" ;;
 	*) oci_arch="${arch}" ;;
 esac
+skopeo_platform="--override-arch '${oci_arch}'${oci_variant:+ --override-variant '${oci_variant}'}"
 
-image_digest=$(retry 3 "skopeo inspect --override-arch '${oci_arch}' 'docker://${full_image_name}' | jq -r '.Digest'")
+image_digest=$(retry 3 "skopeo inspect ${skopeo_platform} 'docker://${full_image_name}' | jq -r '.Digest'")
 
 # Cleanup image name file name use
 image_file_name="${full_image_name//[:\/]/_}@${image_digest//[:\/]/_}"
@@ -61,7 +64,7 @@ dst_image_file_path="${dst_dir}/${image_file_name}.tar"
 	if [ ! -f "${image_file_path}" ]
 	then
 		echo "Fetching image: ${full_image_name} (digest ${image_digest})"
-		retry 3 "skopeo copy --override-arch '${oci_arch}' 'docker://${image_name}@${image_digest}' 'oci-archive:${image_file_path}:${full_image_name}'"
+		retry 3 "skopeo copy ${skopeo_platform} 'docker://${image_name}@${image_digest}' 'oci-archive:${image_file_path}:${full_image_name}'"
 	else
 		echo "Skipping download of existing image: ${full_image_name} (digest ${image_digest})"
 	fi
